Primary Errors:

- Show-label switch can get confused (fixed)

- Move TclFileName downwards in class hierarchy

- Memory allocated is not freed. (although much better now)

- Empty names are visible. (fixed)

- Text is not printed when doing postscript export. (fixed)

Secondary Errors:

- The 3D routines are in an experimental state. This will most probably
  not change until someone will give me a computer with powerful 3D
  facilities.

- Subwindow handling is somewhat buggy due to limitations in the tk
  library and the ffgraph source.

- Some of the graphs in the demographs directory may not work, as icons
are not included in the distribution or paths to subgraphs may be wrong.
